<title>USA: U.S. ammonia prices weaken, DAP flat.</title>
<headline>U.S. ammonia prices weaken, DAP flat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for ammonia were slightly lower on Friday, driven down by weakness on the world market, cash sources said.</p>
<p>High production by Eastern European countries such as Ukraine has contributed to price declines, they noted.</p>
<p>Diammonium phosphate prices were quietly steady.</p>
